00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.092
To the small town.

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.560
They were afraid of losing viewers.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.060
Exactly.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:41.461
They did this

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:42.295
so they didn't lose

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:43.596
