00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:03.796
Absolutely.

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:05.431
I mean, you've seen

00:06:05.431 --> 00:06:06.866
just in the last few

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:08.101
days, it's been reported

00:06:08.101 --> 00:06:09.135
