00:06:18.644 --> 00:06:19.412
All of this

00:06:19.412 --> 00:06:20.613
filing also describes

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:22.081
Rupert Murdoch's relationship

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:24.584
