00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:25.485
well adviser,

00:06:25.485 --> 00:06:27.286
I guess the son in law to the president,

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:28.287
Jared Kushner.

00:06:28.287 --> 00:06:31.357
He was giving information about Biden

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:34.627
ads to Kushner before they ran.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.027
Is that right?

00:06:35.027 --> 00:06:36.729
Again, this is not how a news

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:37.797
network is supposed to operate.

00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:38.264
Theoretically,

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:39.632
this would be a Firable offense

00:06:39.632 --> 00:06:40.633
if someone at,

00:06:40.633 --> 00:06:42.001
you know, any other news network

00:06:42.001 --> 00:06:42.702
were to do this.

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.036
According to the filing

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:45.271
And I read to you from it,

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:47.507
it says that during Trump's campaign,

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:48.574
Rupert Murdoch

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:50.376
provided Trump's son in law

00:06:50.376 --> 00:06:50.843
and senior

00:06:50.843 --> 00:06:51.811
