00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:57.049
along with debate strategy

00:06:57.049 --> 00:06:58.384
before it was public.

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:58.918
Effectively,

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:01.020
I would assume, giving that campaign

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.822
an edge over Biden's.

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:03.689
This is

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:04.891
one of the many things

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:05.358
that we're

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:07.293
learning in these documents

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:09.395
that show that Rupert was helping

00:07:09.395 --> 00:07:11.431
to work with the GOP. In another

00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:14.233
part of the filing or

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:15.435
the previous filing,

00:07:15.435 --> 00:07:16.702
there's a talk about

00:07:16.702 --> 00:07:17.170
do anything

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.871
