00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:34.687
But these

00:07:34.687 --> 00:07:35.988
these documents are pretty damning

00:07:35.988 --> 00:07:37.123
of our Darcy. Appreciate.

00:07:37.123 --> 00:07:38.324
Maggie Haberman Levine,

00:07:38.324 --> 00:07:39.459
